# Party banter while exploring the Village of Barovia. Each node opens with an `if` gate: the node is eligible
# only while its condition holds (engine note in docs/regions/village_of_barovia.md §11). Party members speak
# only through interjections; a line plays if a matching member is present. An exchange between companions names
# them in its gate.

~ banter_shutters
if visited:village_of_barovia and name:thistle and name:wren_featherfoot
interject name:thistle: Whole village shut up tight. In the daytime. Smells like fear and cabbage.
interject name:wren_featherfoot: Maybe they're shy.
interject class:wizard: Or maybe they've read the same history of this valley I have.
endif
-> END

~ banter_lesser
if flag.ismark_met and name:godrick_pendlebrook and name:wren_featherfoot
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: The Lesser, they call him. I was the youngest of six. I know that name, even when nobody says it.
interject name:wren_featherfoot: Held a house a month with one sword. If that's lesser, I'd love to meet the greater.
endif
-> END

~ banter_bites
if flag.ireena_bite_seen and name:liriel_dawnsong and name:wren_featherfoot
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: Two bites on her throat, and she still keeps her own counsel. Most people would be raving by now.
interject name:wren_featherfoot: Nobody's told her she's allowed to break. Let's none of us tell her.
endif
-> END

~ banter_morgantha
if flag.morgantha_met and name:wren_featherfoot and name:thistle
interject name:wren_featherfoot: She pinched my cheek and said I'd keep. Keep for what, madam? Keep for what?
interject name:thistle: Smells wrong, that one. Sweet on top, rotten under. Eat nothing she sells.
elif flag.morgantha_met
interject species:halfling: She pinched my cheek. Like she was checking a melon. Like she was checking a melon for later.
interject tag:blunt: Don't eat anything she sells. I mean it.
endif
-> END

~ banter_pastry
if flag.dream_pastry_eaten and name:ratatoille and name:liriel_dawnsong
interject name:ratatoille: That sample. Underworked crust, far too sweet, and one bite brought dreams all night. I want the recipe.
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: Never eat a stranger's pie in a cursed valley, Ratatoille. We teach it to novices.
interject name:ratatoille: I'll have you know I only want to study it. Professionally.
endif
-> END

~ banter_suspected
if flag.morgantha_suspected and flag.bonegrinder_rumor and name:ratatoille and name:godrick_pendlebrook
interject name:ratatoille: That crust had bone in it. I know flour, and that was not flour. And her windmill sits on the Vallaki road.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: Right. Then we stop at the windmill on the way. And we don't knock.
elif flag.morgantha_suspected and flag.bonegrinder_rumor
interject class:wizard: A windmill on the Vallaki road, ground bone in the crust, and a smile that doesn't move. I have a hypothesis. I don't like it.
interject tag:loyal: Then we stop at that windmill on the way. And we don't knock.
endif
-> END

~ banter_arik
if flag.arik_hollow_noticed and name:ratatoille and name:thistle
interject name:ratatoille: The barkeep. I tried to read him, the way one reads a sauce. There was nothing in the pot.
interject name:thistle: No fear-smell on him. Everybody here stinks of fear. Not him. Nothing.
endif
-> END

~ banter_scholar_note
if flag.scholar_notes_found and name:ratatoille and name:godrick_pendlebrook
interject name:ratatoille: He drew the castle from three sides, then walked up to read in its library. I admire him. I'd prefer not to be him.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: You read his letter out nicely. We should send it on to his college. Somebody there's waiting.
endif
-> END

~ banter_raven
if flag.holy_symbol_rumor and name:liriel_dawnsong and name:godrick_pendlebrook
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: Lost, he said. Not destroyed. A holy thing that is lost is only a holy thing waiting to be found.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: Then we find it. Leave it to me.
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: Gladly. Though perhaps I'll carry the map.
endif
-> END

~ banter_spies
if flag.vistani_spies_suspected and name:wren_featherfoot and name:godrick_pendlebrook
interject name:wren_featherfoot: Those Vistani women were counting us. Heads, blades, purses. I know that look. I used to wear it.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: Then let's give them something good to report. I'll wave.
endif
-> END

~ banter_vigil
if flag.mansion_siege_survived and name:thistle and name:kip_smudgewick
interject name:thistle: Six of them, two doors, one night, and nobody ran. Good fight! Again?
interject name:kip_smudgewick: Respectfully, no. Notwithstanding the excellent company, absolutely not.
endif
-> END

~ banter_doru_destroyed
if flag.doru_destroyed and name:liriel_dawnsong and name:kip_smudgewick
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: At the very end, for a breath, there was a boy looking out of that face. I'll remember that longer than the fight.
interject name:kip_smudgewick: Somebody's son. I keep thinking that. He was somebody's son.
endif
-> END

~ banter_doru_freed
if flag.doru_freed and name:thistle and name:godrick_pendlebrook
interject name:thistle: We let a starving vampire out of a cellar. In a village. Full of slow people.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: He swore he'd go to the castle. On his mother. A lad doesn't lie on his mother.
interject name:thistle: Grandda says never take a hungry thing's word. Hungry things say anything.
endif
-> END

~ banter_hasty
if flag.burial_method == "hasty"
interject class:cleric: We put a man in the ground without a word said over him. That's not a burial. That's tidying.
interject tag:blunt: We were short on time.
interject class:cleric: The dead are always short on time. That's why we're supposed to take ours.
endif
-> END

~ banter_strahd
if flag.strahd_met and name:godrick_pendlebrook and name:ratatoille
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: He's shorter than me. Everyone is. But he talks like he's taller. How does he do that?
interject name:ratatoille: Courtesy costs him nothing, and he wants us to know it. It's garnish. There is no meal underneath.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: A bully in a good coat, then. Sir Pellam always said they fall over like anybody else.
endif
-> END

~ banter_strahd_courteous
if flag.strahd_first_impression == "courteous" and name:kip_smudgewick and name:wren_featherfoot
interject name:kip_smudgewick: We bowed to him. I'd like it on record that I bowed ironically.
interject name:wren_featherfoot: Didn't look ironic, Kip. Looked like you were about to offer him a sample.
interject name:kip_smudgewick: ...I was, a bit.
endif
-> END

~ banter_gertruda
if flag.gertruda_search_promised and name:godrick_pendlebrook and name:thistle
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: We told Mary we'd look. So we look. Every house, every road.
interject name:thistle: Never been outside? Then she walks to the prettiest thing she sees. And the castle's pretty. Bark and bones.
endif
-> END

~ banter_eva
if flag.madam_eva_rumor and name:ratatoille and name:kip_smudgewick
interject name:ratatoille: A seer at Tser Pool. Card-reading is divination for people who can't spell. I would very much like my fortune told.
interject name:kip_smudgewick: Bring coin. Seers always want coin. I'll bring apricots too, in case she barters.
endif
-> END

~ banter_ireena_road
if flag.ireena_in_party and name:liriel_dawnsong and name:wren_featherfoot
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: She's with us now. We keep a double watch at night, and nobody sleeps beside a window.
interject name:wren_featherfoot: She's got a better sword than I have. I don't even have a sword. Is that allowed?
endif
-> END

~ banter_death_house
if flag.death_house_sacrificed
interject class:cleric: We gave that house what it asked for. I'll carry that the length of this valley, and further.
interject tag:blunt: We got out. All of us that could.
interject class:cleric: That's the part I'll carry.
elif flag.death_house_children_at_rest and name:kip_smudgewick and name:liriel_dawnsong
interject name:kip_smudgewick: The children aren't in the road anymore. I keep looking for them anyway. I'd saved them each an apricot.
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: Keep looking, Kip. And keep the apricots. Remembering is a kind of prayer.
endif
-> END
